    <briefdescription>
<para>base class for 2-D interpolations. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Classes derived from this class will provide interpolated values from two sequences of length <formula id="32">$ N $</formula> and <formula id="122">$ M $</formula>, representing the discretized values of the <formula id="134">$ x $</formula> and <formula id="13">$ y $</formula> variables, and a <formula id="209">$ N \times M $</formula> matrix representing the tabulated function values. </para>    </detaileddescription>
